        "id": 0,
        "original_id": "f5b45860-a90d-5b14-a44d-9053875869b5",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Robby Benson, Glynnis O'Connor, Eunice Anderson\n- Films: Jeremy, Beauty and the Beast, A League of Their Own, The Narrows, Falling Awake, Concealed Enemies\n- Television: Friends\n- Places: Manhattan\n\nFacts:\n- Jeremy is a 1973 American romantic drama film about two Manhattan high school students who share a tentative month-long romance.\n- Jeremy stars Robby Benson and Glynnis O'Connor.\n- Eunice Anderson received credit for appearing in Jeremy in 1973.\n- Eunice Anderson received credit for appearing in the made-for-television film Concealed Enemies in 1984.\n- Eunice Anderson received credit for appearing in A League of Their Own in 1992.\n- Eunice Anderson received credit for appearing in The Narrows in 2008.\n- Eunice Anderson received credit for appearing in Falling Awake in 2009.\n- Robby Benson is known as the voice of the Beast in Disney's animated film Beauty and the Beast and its sequels and spin-offs.\n- Robby Benson directed several episodes of the sitcom Friends.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
      {
        "id": 1,
        "original_id": "e59b737c-0691-5962-9cf2-8f893111787b",
        "text": "Page: Jeremy (film). Sentence: Jeremy is a 1973 American romantic drama film starring Robby Benson and Glynnis O'Connor as two Manhattan high school students who share a tentative month-long romance.\nPage: Robby Benson. Sentence: He is known as the voice of The Beast in the Disney animated film \"Beauty and the Beast\" and its numerous sequels and spin-offs, and for directing several episodes of the popular sitcom \"Friends\".\nPage: Eunice Anderson. Sentence: She received credit for appearing in the films \"Jeremy\" (1973), \"A League of Their Own\" (1992), \"The Narrows\" (2008), and \"Falling Awake\" (2009), as well as the made-for-television film \"Concealed Enemies\" (1984).",
